# Code owners (docs/contributing-safety.md). With the main branch's ruleset set to "Require
# review from Code Owners", a pull request that touches any path below merges only after the
# owner approves it. The paths are what keeps the plant, the people and the release safe: sign-in
# and permissions, what the assistant may do, the stores, the sandbox for people's code, the
# installer and the bundle, CI, and the rules the coding agents follow.
# tests/test_contributing_safety.py fails when one of these paths moves without this file.

# Rules for people and coding agents (an edit here steers every later agent session)
/AGENTS.md                                   @PlantCraft/maintainers
/CLAUDE.md                                   @PlantCraft/maintainers
**/AGENTS.md                                 @PlantCraft/maintainers
**/CLAUDE.md                                 @PlantCraft/maintainers
/.claude/                                    @PlantCraft/maintainers
/SECURITY.md                                 @PlantCraft/maintainers
/docs/security-guide.md                      @PlantCraft/maintainers
/docs/contributing-safety.md                 @PlantCraft/maintainers

# CI, the Mac mini runner, the installer, the bundle and the release key's trust list
/.github/                                    @PlantCraft/maintainers
/ci/                                         @PlantCraft/maintainers
/deploy/                                     @PlantCraft/maintainers
/dev/                                        @PlantCraft/maintainers
/Makefile                                    @PlantCraft/maintainers
**/Makefile                                  @PlantCraft/maintainers
/Dockerfile                                  @PlantCraft/maintainers
**/Dockerfile                                @PlantCraft/maintainers
/compose.yaml                                @PlantCraft/maintainers
/.gitleaks.toml                              @PlantCraft/maintainers

# Dependencies (a new or changed package reaches every installation)
/pyproject.toml                              @PlantCraft/maintainers
**/pyproject.toml                            @PlantCraft/maintainers
**/package.json                              @PlantCraft/maintainers
**/package-lock.json                         @PlantCraft/maintainers
**/requirements*.txt                         @PlantCraft/maintainers
**/requirements*.lock                        @PlantCraft/maintainers

